--- how to read this ---
final.sh's own "RC=0" lines are NOT evidence: they capture `tail`'s exit
status, not ctest's, and are 0 whether or not a test failed. The numbers above
come from ctest's own per-test record instead, which is stronger: it says how
many tests ran, not merely that none failed.

All three LastTest.log timestamps fall inside this regression run
(14:04, 14:48, 14:57 on 2026-09-21), so all three are this tree's result.

The two LastTestsFailed.log files are both OLDER than their LastTest.log and
are from earlier runs:
  build/final 13:54  -- control N5, which deliberately broke
                        CFDAppCliLogLinesNeverReachStdout and restored it
  build/debug 11:44  -- a P13-003 run, before those two tests were fixed
